---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Version: preview
Date: 2026-11-10
  Features:
    - Added `make setup macos`, which builds the native dependencies that have no package on macOS (OpenSTA 2.0.17) into `.deps/`, installing python@3.14, Yosys, cmake, swig and tcl-tk@8 from Homebrew. (#85)
    - Added `make setup all`, which additionally builds cqesto, and documented both in the README. (#85)
    - Added specific archivation approaches (.tar.gz, .tar.xz). (#210)
    - Further modularised Configuration Exploration. (#213)
  Minor Features:
    - Added a class for csv formatting. (#213)
    - Added more multipliers verilogs. (#213)
  Major Changes:
    - Completely revised the Timer module and how it works. (#213)
    - Completely revised the argument parsing for Specifications; now more centralised and automated. (#213)
  Minor Changes:
    - `yosys`, `sta` and `cqesto` are now looked up in `.deps/bin` and then on the PATH, from every call site, and a missing executable raises an actionable error instead of a `FileNotFoundError`. (#85)
    - `make setup macos` and `make setup all` now verify the toolchain and fail when `yosys` or `sta` is missing or does not run. (#85)
    - `make py_init` recreates `.venv` when it was created by a different python version. (#85)
    - Added `make rm_deps`, and `make clean-all` now also removes `.deps/`. (#85)
    - Standardised Live/Append Storage interface. (#213)
    - Further modularised Configuration Exploration. (#213)
    - Rewritten all circuits verilogs to simplify understanding and extension. (#213)
    - Reorganised solve/synth/verify pipeline. (#213)
    - Now the default archivation is .tar.xz instead of .zip. (#210)
    - Removed zip archivation approach. (#210)
  Bugfixes:
    - Patched a bug when min-labelling, where no error is found (also added warning). (#213)
  Minor Optimizations:
    - Optimised memory footprint of LiveStorage. (#213)
